      "problem": "Consider the straight line given by the following parametric equations: \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14117480/assets/758d499b0c41e53029bce8f52a23b83925155390601548e8c44617f17486083a.svg)\nWhat would be the vector equation of the line?",
